This license applies to the PIGLasso estimator as implemented in
nodis/estimators/piglasso.py and nodis/estimators/prior_utils.py.

PIGLasso (Prior-Informed Graphical LASSO) is a prior-weighted stability
selection estimator for Gaussian Graphical Models developed as part of Roland
Bumbuc's doctoral research at Amsterdam UMC. It is bundled with NODIS as a
benchmark comparator and for use as a companion inference tool.

Source: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20453217
